  "title": "Odd cycles of Fano planes",
  "subject": "Which triple systems with three lines through every point resist 2-colouring beyond splices of Fano planes",
  "conclusion": "A Fano plane minus a line forces its three free points to one colour, so lines meeting it twice act as not-equal constraints, and a cycle of an odd number of such blocks resists 2-colouring. The knot therefore has three-fold spaces with 21, 27, 35 and more triangles built from both classical obstructions to 2-colouring, the Fano plane and the odd cycle.",
